@lang en
IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `nii-il33-nouns`
IMPORT `nii-il33-readings`
IMPORT `nii-s1-retirement-age-law`

-- ===========================================================================
-- National Insurance Law, Schedule A1 (לוח א׳1): the ages fixed by month of birth, and s 1 "גיל הפרישה".
-- Row IL-33. Source lines 130-132 (the definition) and 4367-4475 (the Schedule).
--
-- Part A  (4369-4396)  the retirement age, for a man and for a woman;
-- Part B  (4399-4412)  the maximum age for unemployment insurance (s 158, s 160, s 247(1)(c), s 406);
-- Part C  (4415-4428)  the age at which one is not insured under Chapter 11 on first becoming a resident (s 240(a));
-- Part D  (4431-4453)  encoded by row IL-08 (nii-schedule-a1-part-d.l4); not re-encoded here;
-- Part E  (4456-4475)  a woman exempt from the qualifying period by her age (s 246(b)(2), read by s 240(b)).
--
-- Each table is generated from the rows as the Schedule prints them (tools are not needed: the rows are
-- quoted above each function and the tests module checks every edge of every band). An age is stated in
-- MONTHS, the unit row IL-05 takes: 65 years and 4 months is 784.
--
-- The tables are stated as the deposited text prints them. The Schedule's heading carries the amendment
-- tag תשס״ד and the Parts the tag תש״ף; no rule here takes a date.
-- ===========================================================================

§ `Schedule A1 — ages by month of birth`

-- A calendar month as one count: twelve times the year plus the month less one.
GIVEN `the month` IS A NUMBER
      `the year`  IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the month count of` `the month` `of` `the year` MEANS
    `the year` TIMES 12 PLUS `the month` MINUS 1

§§ `Part A — the retirement age`

-- The retirement age for a man, by month of birth (s 1 "גיל הפרישה" (1)).
-- src:4371 | ⟦ח:קטע4||גיל הפרישה לגבר⟧
-- src:4375 | חודש הלידה גיל הזכאות (בשנים)
-- src:4376 | עד יוני 1939 65
-- src:4377 | יולי ואוגוסט 1939 65 ו־4 חודשים
-- src:4378 | ספטמבר 1939 עד אפריל 1940 65 ו־8 חודשים
-- src:4379 | מאי עד דצמבר 1940 66
-- src:4380 | ינואר עד אוגוסט 1941 66 ו־4 חודשים
-- src:4381 | ספטמבר 1941 עד אפריל 1942 66 ו־8 חודשים
-- src:4382 | מאי 1942 ואילך 67
@ref NII Schedule A1, Part A, men, lines 4371-4382
GIVEN `the month` IS A NUMBER
      `the year`  IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`Schedule A1, Part A — the retirement age in months of a man born in month` `the month` `of` `the year` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF `born` AT MOST `the month count of` 6  `of` 1939 THEN 780   -- to June 1939: 65
        IF `born` AT MOST `the month count of` 8  `of` 1939 THEN 784   -- July and August 1939: 65 and 4 months
        IF `born` AT MOST `the month count of` 4  `of` 1940 THEN 788   -- September 1939 to April 1940: 65 and 8 months
        IF `born` AT MOST `the month count of` 12 `of` 1940 THEN 792   -- May to December 1940: 66
        IF `born` AT MOST `the month count of` 8  `of` 1941 THEN 796   -- January to August 1941: 66 and 4 months
        IF `born` AT MOST `the month count of` 4  `of` 1942 THEN 800   -- September 1941 to April 1942: 66 and 8 months
        OTHERWISE                                      804   -- May 1942 and after: 67
    WHERE `born` MEANS `the month count of` `the month` `of` `the year`

@ref NII Schedule A1, Part A, men, lines 4371-4382
GIVEN dob IS A DATE
GIVETH A NUMBER
`Schedule A1, Part A — the retirement age in months of a man born on` dob MEANS
    `Schedule A1, Part A — the retirement age in months of a man born in month` (DATE_MONTH dob) `of` (DATE_YEAR dob)

-- The retirement age for a woman, by month of birth, to December 1955 (s 1 "גיל הפרישה" (2)). A woman born in 1956 or later is sent by (2) to the Retirement Age Law, 5764-2004; this table does not cover her and the rule on a person below does.
